# sh-glyphs v1
# ASCII characters the original font has no picture for, because their bytes draw something else there ('[' a
# quote, '_' the space, '`' an apostrophe). The game's text keeps those byte meanings; literal text (mod names,
# file names, labels from data) reaches these glyphs through the fullwidth forms U+FF01..U+FF5E.

# left square bracket [
glyph U+005B advance 6
